--- README.md
+++ README.md
@@ -20,7 +20,7 @@
 
 All desktop tabs share one double-Shift text search with a three-character minimum. It searches the current tab and selected sub-tab, highlighting labels, values, table text and detail data without filtering rows. Enter focuses the first match; Esc, clicking elsewhere, or switching tabs/windows closes search.
 
-The **Tier lists** tab contains **Truck** and **Region Difficulty** sub-tabs. The **Region Difficulty** sub-tab ranks all regions found in the workspace in fixed S, A, B, C, and D tiers, from hardest to easiest. It shares truck tier-list drag-and-drop, reordering, directional scrolling, palette colors, and search, with offline region thumbnails and season labels. Region rankings save automatically in their own file, independently of truck rankings.
+The **Tier lists** tab contains **Truck** and **Region Difficulty** sub-tabs. The **Region Difficulty** sub-tab ranks all regions found in the workspace in fixed S, A, B, C, and D tiers, from hardest to easiest: S red, A orange, B yellow, C green, and D blue. The same colors appear on Region progression tiles; truck tier colors are independent. It shares truck tier-list drag-and-drop, reordering, directional scrolling, palette colors, and search, with offline region thumbnails and season labels. Region rankings save automatically in their own file, independently of truck rankings.
 
